{"meta":{"ph":"ˈsʌðən; NAmE ˈsʌðərn","pos":"adj.","stars":"★"},"defs":[{"def":"located in the south or facing south; connected with or typical of the south part of the world or a region 南方的；向南的；南部的","ex":[{"s":"“I am pleasantly surprised, because I am always looking for where to plug it in,” Espinoza said before catching the subway in a working-class area of southern Barcelona.","src":"2026新高考II卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"“我感到惊喜，因为我一直在找哪里能给车充电，”Espinoza在南巴塞罗那一个工人阶层社区赶地铁前说道。"},{"s":"Yellowstone was the ____49____ (large) United States national park — 2.2 million acres — until Wrangell-Saint Elias in southern Alaska, _____50_____ became a national monument in 1978, took the honors as a national park in 1980 with 12.3 million acres.","src":"2024全国甲卷·语法填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"黄石公园是美国____49____国家公园——220万英亩,直到阿拉斯加南部的Wrangell-Saint Elia____50____s,1978年成为国家纪念碑,1980年以1230万英亩的面积将荣誉作为国家公园."},{"s":"Human speech contains more than 2,000 different sounds, from the common “m” and “a” to the rare clicks of some southern African languages.","src":"2022全国新高考I卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"人类语言包含2000多种不同的声音，从常见的\"m\"和\"a\"到某些南部非洲语言中罕见的咔嗒音。"},{"s":"Southern Spain（15days）","src":"2020全国III卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"西班牙南部(15天)"},{"s":"What can visitors see in both Classical Provence and Southern Spain？","src":"2020全国III卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"游客在古典普罗旺斯和西班牙南部都能看到什么？"},{"s":"The ad had a   51   number for a town in southern Michigan.","src":"2019全国II卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"广告上有一个___51___号码，对应密歇根州南部的一个小镇。"},{"s":"In the Sierra high country, the number of big trees has fallen by more than 55 percent; in parts of southern California the decline was nearly 75 percent.","src":"2019浙江卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"在Sierra高山区，大树的数量下降了超过55%；在南加州部分地区降幅接近75%。"},{"s":"In southern Spain the sudden increase of greenhouses (which reflect light back to space) has changed the warming trend locally, and actually cooled the region.","src":"2017江苏卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"在西班牙南部，温室（把光反射回太空）的突然增加在局部改变了变暖趋势，实际上让该地区变凉了。"},{"s":"What’s more, heavy rain in Eastern Europe has caused landslides, and the heat across Southern Europe has caused forest fires.","src":"外研社B3 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"更何况东欧的暴雨也引发山体滑坡,"},{"s":"For two years, its people had been deep in a civil war between the slave-owning Confederate Southern States and the “free” Northern States of the Union.","src":"外研社B5 U4","cat":"waiyan","t":"两年来,其人民一直深陷南联盟的奴隶所属邦与联盟的“自由”北方邦之间的内战。"},{"s":"Now look for more sentences with this structure in the reading passage, and summarise its use in your own words The red-eared slider, a species of freshwater turtle, is native to the Southern United States and Northern Mexico.","src":"外研社B5 U5","cat":"waiyan","t":"现在在阅读段落中寻找更多带有这种结构的句子,并用你自己的话来总结其用法. 红耳滑轮(英語:The red-eard slipper),一种淡水龟,原产于美国南部和墨西哥北部."},{"s":"Europe Struggles with Heat Wave Countries in Southern Europe have issued warnings after temperatures rose to 40°C.","src":"外研社B5 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"欧洲与南欧热浪国家抗争在气温升至40°C后发布警告."},{"s":"It is primarily found in southern Africa, including South Africa, Angola, Zambia and Mozambique.","src":"外研社B5 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"主要分布于南部非洲,包括南非、安哥拉、赞比亚和莫桑比克。"}]}]}